## Standing -- read before trusting this module

- **Validated locally, never applied.** This module's evidence ceiling is
  `terraform init -backend=false` + `terraform validate` (and `tofu
  validate` as a second engine). No `plan`, no `apply`, no credentials, no
  real GCP project has ever been touched by it.
- A real deploy additionally requires: a real `project_id`, the container
  image mirrored into Artifact Registry (Cloud Run cannot pull
  `ghcr.io` directly), and IAM/billing authority this module neither has
  nor claims.
- Marketplace listing / purchase / entitlement for beam4pm_pro remains
  BLOCKED on external authorities; nothing rendered here changes that.
